{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2>Jay and Silent Bob: Mall Brawl is a full 8-bit retro beat-em-up experience with big levels, big bosses, dope combos, and irreverent references to the View Askewniverse. Mall Brawl can be played solo in a 1 player experience where you swap between both Jay and Silent Bob strategically or played with a buddy, in a 2 player co-operative experience, where you fight your way through mallrats, delinquents and security guards to find your way out of the mall and back to the Quickstop.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Details</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Authentic Retro 8-bit Action<br></li><li> 2 Player Couch Co-op<br></li><li> Single Player Swappable Action Strategy<br></li><li> Unorthodox weapon brandishing tactics<br></li><li> Rogues gallery of View Askew Enemies<br></li><li> A boss with a huge fist<br></li><li> A boss with a pretzel for a head<br></li><li> Contemporary gameplay mechanics<br></li><li> Crisp original chiptune soundtrack</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Jay<br></li><li> Silent Bob<br></li><li> Adoughbo<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>After the incident from the mall that shall remain nameless, the two hetero lifemates are being man hunted by chief rent-a-cop and his off duty officers. Jay and Silent Bob must fight their way through precarious situations in the mall to escape and make it to the Quickstop.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"c02b4a303ffd5eada001b02fed11ca9b0bf037b9.jpg","localized_name":"This Is For Brodie","name":"This Is For Brodie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1087440/c02b4a303ffd5eada001b02fed11ca9b0bf037b9.jpg"},{"icon":"b264b487e88eba545d65eab176234e3ca581bf54.jpg","localized_name":"The Golden Calf","name":"The Golden Calf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1087440/b264b487e88eba545d65eab176234e3ca581bf54.jpg"},{"ic